# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# Phase 4 ships the site on a throwaway *.pages.dev URL. Search engines must
# not index it: authority earned on that hostname is authority thrown away at
# domain cutover, and a half-finished site indexed under the studio's name is
# worse than one not indexed at all. X-Robots-Tag is the header form of
# noindex and covers every response, including ones no HTML meta tag could
# reach. PHASE 7 REMOVES THIS FILE at domain cutover — that is the single step
# that makes the site indexable, so it is deliberately one file, not a setting
# buried in a dashboard. (admin.html additionally carries its own permanent
# noindex meta tag; that one never goes away.)
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
